{"id":5224,"date":"2025-08-27T15:42:53","date_gmt":"2025-08-27T15:42:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5224"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:06:25","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:06:25","slug":"gmv-max-la-gi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/gmv-max-la-gi\/","title":{"rendered":"GMV Max l\u00e0 g\u00ec? H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn A &#8211; Z cho nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng TikTok"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"V0Kidqy2IocGzOxLzIxlADkBgoc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PhYzdOSTDoXaanxVk46lCvetgzg\">\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng n\u00e0o tr\u00ean TikTok Shop, t\u1ed1i \u0111a h\u00f3a doanh thu lu\u00f4n l\u00e0 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u. GMV Max ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n hi\u1ec7n th\u1ef1c h\u00f3a m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u00f3 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng. \u1ede b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> s\u1ebd h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft t\u1eeb A-Z v\u1ec1 GMV Max v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cho gian h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-TyPhddwqMoA9QlxyXqLl9GqXgSf\">GMV Max l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-GgRZd4vMToyKHqxFYa8law3DgRf\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;979c1ac4-5b64-4d2b-831b-78221e5a340f&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCvQXbi17ToWHZvxsKrslfmsEgud%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;CvQXbi17ToWHZvxsKrslfmsEgud&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:480777,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5226\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5226\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5226 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/26cae2b4-e82c-49df-863a-b32a53aaed07.png\" alt=\"GMV Max l\u00e0 g\u00ec?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/26cae2b4-e82c-49df-863a-b32a53aaed07.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/26cae2b4-e82c-49df-863a-b32a53aaed07-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/26cae2b4-e82c-49df-863a-b32a53aaed07-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/26cae2b4-e82c-49df-863a-b32a53aaed07-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/26cae2b4-e82c-49df-863a-b32a53aaed07-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5226\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>GMV Max l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XBCMdCuNJohCruxyW3hlXGhxgPe\" start=\"1\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">Kh\u00e1i ni\u1ec7m c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n v\u1ec1 GMV (Gross Merchandise Value)<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bkd6dzzRGoBl5FxfV34lHhDDgyf\"><strong>GMV (Gross Merchandise Value)<\/strong> l\u00e0 t\u1ed5ng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u00e1n ra tr\u00ean m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng trong m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3ng th\u1eddi gian nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ecbnh, tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi tr\u1eeb \u0111i c\u00e1c chi ph\u00ed nh\u01b0 ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1, v\u00e0 ch\u01b0a bao g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng b\u1ecb h\u1ee7y ho\u1eb7c tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 c\u1ed1t l\u00f5i \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng quy m\u00f4 v\u00e0 t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t gian h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IE3adLPYHoDOhRxV6OPlAHGBgNf\">C\u00f4ng th\u1ee9c t\u00ednh GMV c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EptIdgFqjoh1uzxsbAUlzIdCgCg\">GMV= Gi\u00e1 l\u1ebb c\u1ee7a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u00d7 S\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u00e3 b\u00e1n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLxTd4mEIoAhruxL2MblP2wDgug\" start=\"2\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">\u0110\u1ecbnh ngh\u0129a GMV Max v\u00e0 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau c\u1ee7a n\u00f3<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DhsTdA7hhoXsplxPzagltK2jgHh\"><strong>GMV Max<\/strong> kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t <strong>chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf nh\u1eb1m t\u1ed1i \u0111a h\u00f3a T\u1ed5ng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a (GMV). Thay v\u00ec ch\u1ec9 t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 \u0111\u01a1n l\u1ebb, chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u00e0y t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi 3 &#8220;b\u00ecnh th\u00f4ng nhau&#8221; quan tr\u1ecdng trong kinh doanh:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KWxGduiZ6ol7epxQpO8lXEQJgLj\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng trung b\u00ecnh (AOV &#8211; Average Order Value):<\/strong> Khi\u1ebfn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng chi ti\u00eau nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n trong m\u1ed7i l\u1ea7n mua.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Itadd2Qc6okjfRxHZ2Cl7VMRgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i (CR &#8211; Conversion Rate):<\/strong> Th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng mua h\u00e0ng h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D1V1dr7b9o6klLx6CBclWMDhgIe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>L\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp (Traffic):<\/strong> Thu h\u00fat nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng h\u01a1n \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1edbi gian h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YQUXdTaoYoijC4xtSx2lHUCXgoe\"><strong>M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau c\u1ee7a GMV Max:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ed5ng doanh thu cao nh\u1ea5t c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u00f4ng qua vi\u1ec7c c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n v\u00e0 c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng c\u1ea3 ba y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 tr\u00ean, t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t c\u1ed7 m\u00e1y b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 li\u00ean t\u1ee5c.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O3NrdsPVFo8sDHxLRbileR2Mgeg\" start=\"3\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>T\u1ea1i sao GMV Max quan tr\u1ecdng v\u1edbi nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UjxydOMgQocFQex1Ma4lOSuPgld\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u0103ng doanh thu b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng:<\/strong> Chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c GMV Max gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng doanh thu v\u1eefng ch\u1eafc, kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 duy nh\u1ea5t. Khi m\u1ed9t ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 c\u00f3 d\u1ea5u hi\u1ec7u ch\u1eefng l\u1ea1i, c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 kh\u00e1c c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u00f9 \u0111\u1eafp, gi\u00fap gian h\u00e0ng duy tr\u00ec \u0111\u00e0 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EpvDdZzsCo8IJMxwkNBlwF2Fghe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u0103ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o (ROI):<\/strong> Khi b\u1ea1n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u t\u1ed1t T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i v\u00e0 Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng trung b\u00ecnh, m\u1ed7i \u0111\u1ed3ng chi cho qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat L\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp s\u1ebd mang l\u1ea1i l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn cao h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GL8hdcLdrojNJNxYm6elyOD8gcg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kinh doanh v\u1eefng ch\u1eafc:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7c t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o c\u1ea3 AOV, CR v\u00e0 Traffic bu\u1ed9c b\u1ea1n ph\u1ea3i ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n m\u1ecdi kh\u00eda c\u1ea1nh c\u1ee7a gian h\u00e0ng, t\u1eeb s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, n\u1ed9i dung, qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ebfn ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t l\u1ee3i th\u1ebf c\u1ea1nh tranh l\u00e2u d\u00e0i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-FYKodY9t5o8Kzrxesinll5hZgBb\">C\u00e1c y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 c\u1ea5u th\u00e0nh v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch t\u1ed1i \u01b0u GMV Max<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XF84daU3FoCUanx5TgtlMjE3gUc\">\u0110\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c thi chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c GMV Max, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 v\u00e0 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p t\u1ed1i \u01b0u cho t\u1eebng y\u1ebfu to.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F2KKde8QuoMIv4xa1KGlIzkwg7b\" start=\"1\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng trung b\u00ecnh (AOV &#8211; Average Order Value)<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-recor