 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f5877b7d-76f9-4012-bf87-a5c5d69c19d7-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f5877b7d-76f9-4012-bf87-a5c5d69c19d7-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f5877b7d-76f9-4012-bf87-a5c5d69c19d7-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f5877b7d-76f9-4012-bf87-a5c5d69c19d7-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5227\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng trung b\u00ecnh (AOV &#8211; Average Order Value)<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;9aac328e-c427-4399-b517-50bf3c2bec9f&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FEAsWb1iOTonikXx4c54l7WbVg3e%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;EAsWb1iOTonikXx4c54l7WbVg3e&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:57236,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"V0Kidqy2IocGzOxLzIxlADkBgoc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VMXzdanKdo05MExR81NlgGAagee\">AOV l\u00e0 s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n trung b\u00ecnh m\u00e0 m\u1ed9t kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng chi ti\u00eau cho m\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng. T\u0103ng AOV l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch nhanh nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 gia t\u0103ng doanh thu m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n t\u0103ng th\u00eam traffic.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FfJodYIHgo49wAx641KlN1mwgDc\"><strong>C\u00e1ch t\u1ed1i \u01b0u AOV:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S0qZdgAPvo2g9qxdcBmlHapmgqs\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>G\u1ee3i \u00fd s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m li\u00ean quan (Cross-sell):<\/strong> Khi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng th\u00eam m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc \u00e1o v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng, h\u00e3y \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t th\u00eam qu\u1ea7n ho\u1eb7c ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n \u0111i k\u00e8m ngay tr\u00ean trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ho\u1eb7c trong gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXnmdSn4AoTdiVxS0kZlJvVRgjc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u00e1n combo s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m (Bundles):<\/strong> T\u1ea1o c\u00e1c g\u00f3i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn nh\u01b0 &#8220;B\u1ed9 g\u1ed9i x\u1ea3&#8221; hay &#8220;Combo 3 \u00e1o ph\u00f4ng&#8221; v\u1edbi m\u1ee9c gi\u00e1 \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i h\u01a1n so v\u1edbi mua l\u1ebb.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H7Ardk66poNrACxcaKjlUMaFgIc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh &#8220;Mua nhi\u1ec1u gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1&#8221;:<\/strong> Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp c\u00e1c \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i l\u0169y ti\u1ebfn nh\u01b0 &#8220;Mua 2 gi\u1ea3m 10%, mua 3 gi\u1ea3m 15%&#8221; \u0111\u1ec3 khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng mua s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng l\u1edbn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X4ordkgEgoMisFxESbelfUdbggf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n (Freeship Extra):<\/strong> \u0110\u1eb7t ra m\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1ee1ng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, v\u00ed d\u1ee5: &#8220;Freeship cho \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb 200.000 VN\u0110&#8221;.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKXHdNQT7oz97QxLaqXls0Rwgaf\">Vi\u1ec7c x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i v\u00e0 k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 am hi\u1ec3u s\u00e2u s\u1eafc v\u1ec1 th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng. C\u00e1c <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/dich-vu\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng E-commerce \u0111a s\u00e0n<\/a><\/strong> chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c AOV t\u1ed1i \u01b0u nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YRz0d5YReo3pIixmrUZlJcq2gW9\" start=\"2\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i (CR &#8211; Conversion Rate)<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-HWDHdSoDcoEsiLxarlZlVt6ug6b\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d475c166-2cbd-43d3-bb6a-49720f42b9f2&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FF85NbfVvcoaYi1xKBMRl7HTKgPg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;F85NbfVvcoaYi1xKBMRl7HTKgPg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:474224,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;d475c166-2cbd-43d3-bb6a-49720f42b9f2&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&qu