00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng (CTA) m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd, r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OI6rdnMnLooGycxzQZ6laIzsg0f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ed1i \u01b0u trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> M\u1ed9t trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh\/video ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao, s\u1eafc n\u00e9t, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 chi ti\u1ebft, \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 th\u00f4ng tin (ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc, c\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng) v\u00e0 c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u00edch c\u1ef1c t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua tr\u01b0\u1edbc. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o d\u1ef1ng ni\u1ec1m tin v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh mua h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5fdIoSVogl5hxW7c5lFRnGgee\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Livestream hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3:<\/strong> Livestream l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 &#8220;ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n&#8221; c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd. T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp, gi\u1ea3i \u0111\u00e1p th\u1eafc m\u1eafc ngay l\u1eadp t\u1ee9c, v\u00e0 tung ra c\u00e1c \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n trong phi\u00ean live s\u1ebd t\u1ea1o ra c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c c\u1ea5p b\u00e1ch, th\u00f4i th\u00fac kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng mua ngay.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BRNBdzfJEorUSIxBGNBl7hehgYc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng quan t\u00e2m v\u00e0 mua s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KwhAdRonVofA6FxLWTqlHdsDgof\" start=\"3\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">L\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp (Traffic)<\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-NrjKdIfinoEg7oxq9jNlEg53gpf\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6d6b40a0-f3fd-4a92-894e-22eb30dbd63a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FIvRgbqnKgopmnaxZAmsl4tuZg6b%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;IvRgbqnKgopmnaxZAmsl4tuZg6b&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:455663,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6d6b40a0-f3fd-4a92-894e-22eb30dbd63a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FIvRgbqnKgopmnaxZAmsl4tuZg6b%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;IvRgbqnKgopmnaxZAmsl4tuZg6b&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:455663,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5229\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5229\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5229\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/88a88653-8793-499c-8a30-9a12ba6e7ca1.png\" alt=\"L\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp (Traffic)\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/88a88653-8793-499c-8a30-9a12ba6e7ca1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/88a88653-8793-499c-8a30-9a12ba6e7ca1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/88a88653-8793-499c-8a30-9a12ba6e7ca1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/88a88653-8793-499c-8a30-9a12ba6e7ca1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/88a88653-8793-499c-8a30-9a12ba6e7ca1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5229\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>L\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp (Traffic)<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6d6b40a0-f3fd-4a92-894e-22eb30dbd63a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FIvRgbqnKgopmnaxZAmsl4tuZg6b%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;IvRgbqnKgopmnaxZAmsl4tuZg6b&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:455663,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"V0Kidqy2IocGzOxLzIxlADkBgoc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B24Adcre6o4bejxHgSflkPphgJb\">Traffic l\u00e0 t\u1ed5ng s\u1ed1 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111\u00e3 truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o k\u00eanh TikTok, video, livestream ho\u1eb7c trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. Kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 traffic, s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SNq0d8LSToRvZHxiEKtly6Dfg8f\"><strong>C\u00e1ch t\u1ed1i \u01b0u Traffic:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JOu1dlT7UovsHbx3PCNlQYgagv3\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng n\u1ed9i dung k\u00eanh s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o:<\/strong> \u0110\u0103ng t\u1ea3i video \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n, b\u1eaft k\u1ecbp c\u00e1c xu h\u01b0\u1edbng (trending hashtags, \u00e2m thanh ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn) \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng video \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2MJdyCADoPSY4xwL3FlYmWWg0g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Livestream th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean:<\/strong> M\u1ed7i phi\u00ean livestream l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0n ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng m\u1edbi \u0111ang online.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PriHd4sRloyOZ3x1cVplg63egXe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Ads:<\/strong> \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch nhanh nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng v\u1ecdt l\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp. C\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp t\u1ed1t s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1edbi ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OashdusLgopg56xq0zElzv0wg6d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>H\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u1edbi KOC\/KOL:<\/strong> T\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng s\u1ee9c \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng v\u00e0 t\u1ec7p ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i trung th\u00e0nh c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng truy c\u1eadp ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-VNgKdfNFxoRX9axuEMnludLjgUf\">X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c GMV Max hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtGFdK5o5ocipdxhueTloUW6geg\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c GMV Max th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c th\u1ee7 thu\u1eadt ri\u00eang l\u1ebb m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t quy tr\u00ecnh v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh b\u00e0i b\u1ea3n.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PUWedbSXqoVrdKxEEanleP73gW8\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch v\u00e0 \u0110\u1eb7t m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau:<\/strong> B\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u b\u1eb1ng vi\u1ec7c nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng, ph\u00e2n t\u00edch \u0111\u1ed1i th\u1ee7 c\u1ea1nh tranh v\u00e0 xem x\u00e9t ngu\u1ed3n l\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a ch\u00ednh b\u1ea1n. T\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3, \u0111\u1eb7t ra m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau GMV c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, kh\u1ea3 thi v\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng theo t\u1eebng giai \u0111o\u1ea1n (ng\u00e0y, tu\u1ea7n, th\u00e1ng).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D0rKdFJbDoeJy4xy8Xml7wNtgLf\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>L\u1eadp k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch chi ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch n\u1ed9i dung cho video, l\u1ecbch livestream, v\u00e0 c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o. Ph\u00e2n b\u1ed5 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1 h\u1ee3p l\u00fd cho t\u1eebng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z94wdVXKJoKFN8x2zMYlpur6gDb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch d\u1eef li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 TikTok Shop Seller Center \u0111\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i s\u00e1t sao c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 AOV, CR, v\u00e0 Traffic. Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch xem y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 n\u00e0o \u0111ang ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1ed1t, y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 n\u00e0o c\u1ea7n c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GhUidGpsCoGPEUxtma7l3clWghf\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>C\u1ea3i ti\u1ebfn v\u00e0 T\u1ed1i \u01b0u li\u00ean t\u1ee5c:<\/strong> D\u1ef1a tr\u00ean d\u1eef li\u1ec7u \u0111\u00e3 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch, \u0111\u1eebng ng\u1ea7n ng\u1ea1i th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh. C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n thay \u0111\u1ed5i n\u1ed9i dung video, \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i ho\u1eb7c t\u1ed1i \u01b0u l\u1ea1i chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-VGgzdQV06o4Y6Bx5srulBe5agIn\">Nh\u1eefng sai l\u1ea7m c\u1ea7n tr\u00e1nh khi t\u1ed1i \u01b0u GMV Max<\/h2>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WHNndtkvcoQ6NUxVDHjlUMZWg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ch\u1ec9 t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1:<\/strong> Nhi\u1ec1u nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng m\u1eafc sai l\u1ea7m khi \u0111\u1ed5 to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch v\u00e0o qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ec3 k\u00e9o traffic (Traffic) m\u00e0 b\u1ecf qua vi\u1ec7c t\u1ed1i \u01b0u trang s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m (CR) hay c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh t\u0103ng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng (AOV). \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ebfn chi ph\u00ed cao nh\u01b0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 th\u1ea5p.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YBqzdobWgoOhDWxd1TwlO7xcgQd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u1ecf qua tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng:<\/strong> S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u00fang m\u00f4 t\u1ea3, th\u1eddi gian chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb h\u00e0ng l\u00e2u, hay d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng k\u00e9m s\u1ebd l\u00e0m gi\u1ea3m t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i v\u00e0 gi\u1ebft ch\u1ebft uy t\u00edn th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z56odT04wo8ZZVx1B8ilOTjUgZf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Kh\u00f4ng c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt xu h\u01b0\u1edbng:<\/strong> Thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n v\u00e0 th\u1ecb hi\u1ebfu ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng tr\u00ean TikTok thay \u0111\u1ed5i li\u00ean t\u1ee5c. N\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt c\u00e1c xu h\u01b0\u1edbng m\u1edbi, n\u1ed9i dung c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd tr\u1edf n\u00ean l\u1ed7i th\u1eddi v\u00e0 k\u00e9m hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IjeddBkiboYObzx0EjVlJBwUg3g\">GMV Max l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c kinh doanh to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n, l\u00e0 kim ch\u1ec9 nam gi\u00fap c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng doanh thu m\u00e0 c\u00f2n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng m\u1ed9t th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng. Ch\u00eca kh\u00f3a th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng n\u1eb1m \u1edf s\u1ef1 th\u1ea5u hi\u1ec3u, c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u li\u00ean t\u1ee5c c\u1ea3 ba y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 c\u1ed1t l\u00f5i: <strong>Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng trung b\u00ecnh (AOV), T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i (CR), v\u00e0 L\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp (Traffic)<\/strong>. B\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch linh ho\u1ea1t v\u00e0 b\u00e0i b\u1ea3n, b\u1ea1n ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 chinh ph\u1ee5c nh\u1eefng c\u1ed9t m\u1ed1c doanh thu \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok \u0111\u1ea7y ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FnMpdlmeroUMmBxzO45lyb2Lg8f\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CiNPdL9yGogrOWx5SP9lClWZgQe\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXbIdAJxhoMK78xlitmlwna7gJi\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4zHdkc9moG0p4xCDsMlPfuCgLg\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1zOdpTlKoctbZx2CeclelbEgNe\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PLSVdBWXkoC8WCxZhallVoJrgfc\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng n\u00e0o tr\u00ean TikTok Shop, t\u1ed1i \u0111a h\u00f3a doanh thu lu\u00f4n l\u00e0 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u. GMV Max ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n hi\u1ec7n th\u1ef1c h\u00f3a m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau \u0111\u00f3 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng. \u1ede b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y, Lemon Digital s\u1ebd h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft t\u1eeb A-Z [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5698,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[29,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5224","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-tiktok","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5224","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection